# Security baseline

EXPORT POLICY security:
  ABOUT  baseline security rules every agent in this project respects
  APPLIES #security #baseline universal

  ALWAYS  validate every input crossing a trust boundary
  ALWAYS  treat secrets as opaque tokens — never log, never echo
  ALWAYS  fail closed when a permission check is ambiguous

  NEVER  commit credentials, .env files, or private keys
  NEVER  bypass authentication for "internal" callers
